# observation — a thing is declined once, and the mind that declined is not asked again
#
# A click on a kind asks the mind chosen to look at one thing of that kind, of its own choosing —
# or to say that nothing there draws it. The declining costs its point like any observation, stands
# on the map as a refusal, and is spent for every mind: the next mind asked about the same kind in
# the same area has to attend to something. The mind that declined is listed greyed in the popup
# for that question and cannot be picked — asked again it would decline again, and the point would
# be spent to hear it twice — so the second ask needs another mind.
#
# --refuse-focus stands in for the choice judge answering "nothing here", which --playground never
# does: it forces the decline wherever one is allowed.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Yard" --period dawn --refuse-focus

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60
advance 12 180

# Childhood Memory is asked to look at a thing, and declines.
click observe thing
choose childhood_memory
advance 12 180
expect-state texts "Nothing here draws my attention"
expect-state trees refusal area="Test Yard" mind=childhood_memory
expect-no-state trees element
expect-state noetic points=2/3

# Asked the same again, it is greyed in the popup and cannot be picked: no point is spent on it.
click observe thing
expect-state popup childhood_memory(refused)
choose childhood_memory
expect-state noetic points=2/3
expect-no-state trees element

# Another mind is asked, and may not decline: the thing's one declining is spent.
choose comradeship
advance 12 180
expect-state trees element
expect-state trees observer=comradeship
expect-state noetic points=1/3

# The refusal was about things in the yard. About people there, Childhood Memory may be asked.
click observe person
expect-state popup minds=[
expect-no-state popup (refused)
quit
